    <string name="mim_s21_delete_data_confirm_title">Delete all your data?</string>
    <string name="mim_s22_delete_data_confirm_body">Everything RunWear holds for you will be deleted from our server and this phone: your photos, every picture made from them, and your account itself. This can\'t be undone. Deleting your data does not cancel a subscription — you can manage that from your store account.</string>
