    <string name="mim_u2e_how_premium_works">How Premium works</string>
    <string name="mim_u2f_how_premium_works_body">Looks of you for every scenario. This week\'s weather is made first; the rest are made as you need them, and each one is banked for good once it\'s made.</string>
